<TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype></TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype><rdf:label>billingID</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The billing instance identifier for this capability.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billingTemplateID -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billingTemplateID">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#Attribute"/><TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>BillingCapabilitySpecification</TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>
<TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype></TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype><rdf:label>billingTemplateID</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The unique identifier of the billing template to be used for billing an offer.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billingType -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billingType">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#Attribute"/><TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>BillingCapabilitySpecification</TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>
<TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype></TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype><rdf:label>billingType</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>The billing type determines how a billing capability recognize revenue for a given offer</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billNo -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#billNo">
<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#Attribute"/><TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>PartyBill</TMF_SID_v1:hasOrigin>
<TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype></TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype><rdf:label>billNo</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>A user friendly identification number of a bill.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

<!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#bookedQuantity -->

<owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://www.semanticweb.org/igork/ontologies/2024/1/TMF_SID_v1#bookedQuantity">
