<TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype></TMF_SID_v1:hasStereotype><rdf:label>trafficClass</rdf:label>
<rdfs:comment>This attribute states the traffic class for the priority and vlanRange to which this row applies.</rdfs:comment>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

